	(text "SWD on TC2050-IDC-NL pads (no header on the board). The TC2050-IDC cable maps 1:1\nonto the standard ARM 10-pin Cortex debug connector, so an ST-LINK-V3 plugs\nstraight in. USART3 (same pins as the Disco VCP) on a 3-pin 1.27mm header for the\nserial log."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 162.56 0)
